<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5985" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφιπένομαι</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 only pres. and impf., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πένομαι ἀμφί τινα</span>
			, <i>to be busied about, take charge of,</i> c. acc. pers., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἵ μευ πατέρ᾽ ἀμφεπένοντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					15.467
				</span></i>
			; of people <i>tending</i> a wounded man, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.220
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				19.455
			</span></i>: c. acc. rei, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῶρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					19.278
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάφον, στόλον, δόρπον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.925
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1199
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.883
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.271
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν οὐ κύνες ἀμφεπένοντο</span> dogs
				<i>made</i> not <i>a meal of</i> him, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.184
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				21.203
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέων . . ὅν τ᾽ ἐν ὄρεσσιν ἀνέρες
					ἀμφιπένονται</span>”
				<i>hem in,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.27
				</span></i>
			.</div>
